title: "GPU Architecture for AI"

abstract: >
  A hands-on learning repository that explains modern GPU architecture
  and GPU execution for AI workloads, progressing from threads, warps,
  thread blocks, SMs, and memory hierarchy to AI workloads, multi-GPU
  systems, and production GPU engineering.

